        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Stainless Steel Dimpled T-Strike Plate for Ball and Roller Catches</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe stainless steel door latch strike plate is for use with ball and roller catches. It is available in 2 finishes and 5 lip sizes: 1-1/2 inch, 1-3/4 inches, 2 inches, 2-1/2 inches, and 3 inches. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Don-Jo DJO-DT91xx Dimpled T-Strike Plate:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Base Width: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: 304 Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Finishes: Satin Stainless Steel or Black</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with Mounting Screws</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 5 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>DT9115</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Lip Extension Length: 1-1/2\" Lip</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Base Width: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>DT9175</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Lip Extension Length: 1-3/4\" Lip</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 2.313\"</li>\r\n<li>Base Width: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>DT9102</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Lip Extension Length: 2\" Lip</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 2.563\"</li>\r\n<li>Base Width: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>DT9125</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Lip Extension Length: 2-1/2\" Lip</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 3.063\"</li>\r\n<li>Base Width: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>DT9103</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Lip Extension Length: 3\" Lip</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 3.563\"</li>\r\n<li>Base Width: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
